WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.800
A few weeks ago, I met Emily, this wonderful elegant person

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.200
Our sons brought us together actually

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.000
Come here little dude. Can me and Miles have a play date today?

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.660
Do you drink? Does your kid drink? Maybe, I mean, it's never too early to start teaching them

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.500
I think you're joking, but great

00:00:30.369 --> 00:00:32.369
Every time we do this I feel so high town

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.340
Wanna trade confessions?

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:36.180
No, no

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.220
Come on, what's the wildest thing you've ever done?

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:42.600
She's an enigma, my wife. You can get close to her but you can never quite reach her

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:45.120
Oh, she's like a beautiful ghost

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.300
Did you just take my picture?

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:51.359
Erase it. I guess I'm probably not the kind of person you're normally friends with

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.969
Oh, you do not want to be friends with me. Trust me

00:00:56.469 --> 00:01:04.408
Stephanie I need your help. Are you okay? I'm fine, but I do need just a simple favor. Can you come over? Yeah

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:09.399
Five days ago Emily went missing

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:21.280
I warn you, you go poking around in her past, you're gonna find something that is terrifying

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
She was not a normal person like you or me

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:29.100
I've never seen such a beautiful girl want to be so invisible

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:36.400
I smell her Sean. I smell her perfume like a ghost. It's just you being paranoid

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:38.420
I saw my mom.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.320
She told me to say hi to Stephanie

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:59.320
Were you aware that he took out an extra four million dollar life insurance policy on Emily before she disappeared?

00:02:00.229 --> 00:02:05.618
People do terrible things for their own reasons. I thought you knew more than you were letting on

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:11.960
I wanna know your secret

